~ start
Mio: What?
Mio: .... a cat?
Mio: Welcome little cat.
You can tell the giant minotaur looks sad.
Mio: Oh.. That... Well recently our dungeon has been infested by an evil entity named Skester.
Mio: He has corrupted my friends and I miss playing Telt with them so dearly.
- I can help
    do WorldDialogueManager.MarkBossInteracted()
    Mio: Oh that would be great! Let me teach you the rules of our card game Telt.
    do WorldDialogueManager.StartBossBattle()
    => END
- That doesn't sound like my problem.
    do WorldDialogueManager.MarkBossInteracted()
    Mio: Oh...
    do WorldDialogueManager.EndDialogue()
    => END
	
~ BackForMore
Mio: Are you ready to learn Telt now?
- Yes
    do WorldDialogueManager.MarkBossInteracted()
    do WorldDialogueManager.StartBossBattle()
	 => END
- No
    do WorldDialogueManager.MarkBossInteracted()
	Mio: Oh...
    do WorldDialogueManager.EndDialogue()
    => END
	
~ PostBattle
Mio: Good job! Now please go and help my friends.
You hear a click and a rumbling in the distance as if a path has opened.
Mio: Here, take this. It can help you on your journey.
"You received [color=yellow]Mio[/color]'s card."
do WorldDialogueManager.EndDialogue()
=> END